WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.020
A transfer student?

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.560
Coming to our class, apparently.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.820
I wonder what they'll be like.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.820
Yeah?

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.620
Mamiya-san.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.390
If You Don't Mind Starting as Friends

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.390
Only one request letter, huh?

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:02.600
They didn't even leave any offerings.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.520
That's so lame.

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:07.020
Help me

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:06.540
"Help me"?

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.940
Help me.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.530
Help me.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.780
It's a spirit, Rinne-sama.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:27.910
He's gone.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:38.050
There was another one, huh?

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:39.550
You can see me?

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.160
A normal person shouldn't 
be able to see Rinne

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.470
when he's wearing his 
Haori of the Underworld.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.950
Stop hesitating and rest in peace!

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:48.980
Holy Ash.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.560
Are you all right, Rinne-sama?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:55.000
<i>Rinne is a spirit entity when he is 
wearing his Haori of the Underworld.</i>

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.820
<i>Therefore, he is vulnerable to 
the same things a spirit is.</i>

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.590
There's no sense running.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.870
You'll soon perish.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:13.330
<i>But he's fine once he takes his haori off.</i>

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.850
What was his problem?

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:18.470
Such unprovoked violence.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.800
Oh, he's not gone.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.850
I was just fleeing earlier.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.190
Because you threw things at me.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:31.060
This is Holy Ash made 
specifically for evil spirits.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.560
I'm not an evil spirit.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.270
Besides, I can't rest 
with something like this.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.780
Huh? He dropped something.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.160
A photo.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.720
It's a cute girl.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.890
With a ton of spirits.

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:51.540
It's...

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.790
It's Mamiya Sakura.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.640
I'm introducing the new student.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:58.380
Hey.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.390
He's kind of hot.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:08.560
Mamiya-san, it's me.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:09.390
Huh?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.770
You know him, Sakura-chan?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.460
It's me, remember?

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.770
We were together in elementary 
school for a short while.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.900
Don't tell me you've forgotten.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.860
Umm... Oreda-kun?

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.200
<i>Oreda?!</i>

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:27.890
Oreda

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:32.750
Jumonji
Tsubasa

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.340
Sakura-chan, look.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:35.620
Tsubasa-kun.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:37.690
You remembered me!

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.450
Of course I did.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.130
Liar. You liar.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.180
<i>Mamiya Sakura-san.</i>

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:48.890
<i>Not a day went by that I didn't think of you.</i>

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.750
<i>I moved over and over, ever since I was little,
because of my family's circumstances.</i>

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.400
<i>I had trouble making friends as it was.</i>

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.470
<i>On top of that, I could see 
things since I was little,</i>

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.280
<i>and I was always an outcast wherever I went.</i>

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:08.100
<i>Ever since I realized I wasn't normal, 
I'd kind of given up on making friends.</i>

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:09.860
<i>That's when...</i>

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.960
I like medium-thick wavy noodles.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.680
You're insane.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:18.040
Nothing beats straight thin ramen noodles.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:19.810
Mamiya-san.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:23.090
Hey, Jumonji-kun, the transfer student.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.940
Take this, Holy Ash!

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:26.430
Look out!

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:29.090
Jumonji-kun, you can see him?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:33.850
<i>It was the first time I met 
anyone else that could see them.</i>

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:38.150
Yeah? Your parents are exorcists?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:39.310
Yeah.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:44.190
<i>It was the first time I held a friendly 
conversation with a classmate.</i>

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.410
We're the same, huh?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.200
Yeah.

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.540
It'll be our secret that we can see things.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.090
<i>Ker-thump!</i>

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:53.760
Yeah.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:56.960
<i>That was my first love.</i>

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:02.650
<i>But the spirit my dad was chasing fled 
to Hokkaido, and we moved again.</i>

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:06.260
<i>We were torn apart before we even 
had a chance to say goodbye.</i>

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:12.050
So anyway, Mamiya-san, 
please go out with me.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.360
What? But, but, Sakura-chan...

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.310
Aren't you going out with Rokudou-kun?

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.300
Huh?

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:24.900
Rokudou-kun.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.050
You!

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:29.410
You still haven't passed on?!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:33.540
Mamiya Sakura.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.490
Are you acquainted?

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.450
Yeah, I guess.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.270
You dropped this.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.970
Mamiya-san, who's he?

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:45.090
Our classmate, Rokudou-kun.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.960
<i>He's not a spirit?</i>

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:49.190
Your way of doing things is wrong.

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.370
What? Would you care to explain?

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.970
You're too aggressive.

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:56.850
Are you talking about my 
exorcisms or my confessions?

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.450
Is anyone talking about your confession?

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:02.120
Is it true that you're 
going out with Mamiya-san?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.010
Since when were we talking about that?

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:06.290
I asked her out, fair and square.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:11.730
There're two guys fighting over Sakura-chan.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.120
They're just not making sense to each other.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.620
We're in homeroom right now. Sit down.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.610
We're done.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:22.420
Let's go home.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:23.900
Mamiya-san.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.890
Tsubasa-kun.

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.550
Want to walk home together?

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:30.510
I still haven't gotten 
an answer from earlier.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.650
He's really assertive.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.340
What's Sakura-chan going to do?

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.090
Sorry, Tsubasa-kun, hang on.

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:44.940
Hey, Rokudou-kun.

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:47.020
Mamiya Sakura.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.170
Do you have more requests today?

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:49.800
Yeah.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:51.780
I'm about to go for a hearing investigation.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.320
You're going to exorcise a spirit, huh?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.760
I'll go with you, then.

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.210
I can do it alone.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:58.910
Huh?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:03.740
But there might be something I can help with.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:04.910
I'll go with you.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.220
No, it's fine.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:09.280
You're kind of different today, Rokudou-kun.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:10.630
That's not true.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:14.510
Is what happened earlier bothering you?

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.600
It's up to you to decide who you go out with.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:25.690
Besides, I'm not interested 
in that kind of stuff.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.480
Oh, really?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.570
Okay.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:32.980
See you.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.420
What?

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:38.490
Sakura-sama isn't coming?

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:39.460
Nope.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.240
Now, tell me your regrets.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:43.500
Right.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.520
I'll go call her.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.340
Rokumon, don't go causing trouble.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:54.340
Mrowwwr

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:54.340
Oh, no. Sakura-sama's walking 
home happily with a boy!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.560
Oh yeah?

00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:00.310
So you're still keeping it a 
secret that you can see spirits.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.350
Yeah.

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:03.250
Otherwise it gets complicated.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.100
Are you working as an exorcist, Tsubasa-kun?

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.720
It's a family business.

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:11.860
So I could protect you from 
evil spirits any time.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:13.940
<i>Evil spirits?</i>

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.740
<i>But it's not like I'm being 
attacked all the time.</i>

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:20.910
<i>Actually, I've been in 
danger pretty often lately.</i>

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:23.750
<i>Rokudou-kun saves me every time, though.</i>

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.690
<i>Wait, it's the other way around.</i>

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:29.460
<i>Maybe I'm always in danger 
because I'm around Rokudou-kun.</i>

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.760
Hey, Mamiya-san, are you really 
going out with Rokudou?

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.680
I'm not interested in that kind of stuff.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.630
No, I'm not.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.120
Then, how about me?

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:46.380
We have to start off as friends.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.360
Really?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.690
Yay!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:51.820
Holy Ash!

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.160
Was there something there?

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.240
Maybe I imagined it.

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:03.540
It's that awful man that 
attacked me this morning.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:07.620
Rinne-sama, are you really okay with 
a guy like him taking Sakura-sama?

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:09.780
He's not taking anything.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:12.500
Mamiya Sakura isn't mine.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.900
We're leaving, Rokumon.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.590
Rinne-sama.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.590
You can't fly without your haori on.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:24.330
Is he flustered?

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.490
Hi.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:28.830
Morning.

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:29.770
Morning.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.820
Sakura-sama.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.010
Rokumon-chan.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.570
What did you need my help with?

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.520
I want you to hear him out.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:42.120
Hello.

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:45.270
<i>I'll explain one last time.</i>

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:50.650
<i>Rinne's Haori of the Underworld can 
materialize spirits when it's worn inside-out.</i>

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:54.190
That glasses kid is the spirit?

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.710
Why is he talking to Miho-chan?

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:00.050
Usui-kun? From the seat next 
to me in middle school?

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.350
Sorry, uh...

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:04.250
I'm sure you wouldn't remember me.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.720
We never spoke.

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:09.380
Did that glasses kid like Miho-chan?

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:12.890
He's been trying to become close 
to her since middle school,

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:15.130
so he applied for this high school.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:20.980
But being so sickly, he passed away 
without coming to school once.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:23.910
I see. Poor guy.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:26.510
You're going to be in the hospital soon?

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:28.260
I'm sickly.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:31.750
Before he does, do you think you could 
go on a date with him just once?

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.290
All right, in that case.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.340
Really?

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.720
Don't let him fool you!

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.340
Explain this, Rokudou.

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.640
Why is he here?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:51.690
What's he talking about?

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.890
I-I don't know.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.560
Wait, wait.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.900
Let's talk this over.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.360
Sakura-chan.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.230
Mamiya Sakura.

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:04.050
Tsubasa-kun, you can't tell her 
that the glasses kid is a spirit.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.200
But...

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.460
Miho is his regret.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.160
He'll be able to rest in peace 
once he goes on a date with her.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.560
You're too soft.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.000
What if he turns evil?

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:17.260
Hey, Sakura-chan, let's go on a double date.

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:19.740
I don't know him too well.

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:21.720
And it'll be fun with more people.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:22.510
Huh?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.480
In that case, I'll go with you.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.740
What?

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.000
Don't worry.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.060
I'll watch to make sure Tsubasa-kun 
doesn't do anything violent.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.720
It's a date.

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:38.570
All right, Mamiya-san, I'll 
be looking forward to it.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:44.570
<i>I took advantage of the situation 
to ask her out on a date!</i>

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:52.120
Sakura-chan, are you sure you didn't 
want to go with Rokudou-kun instead?

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:54.040
Well, it just kind of happened.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:59.820
<i>But why didn't Rokudou-kun 
talk to me about it?</i>

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:02.550
<i>Miho-chan's my friend.</i>

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:05.040
Huh, Rokudou-kun?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.430
He's gone.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.610
<i>Jeez, Rokudou-kun.</i>

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.930
<i>He's been acting rude since yesterday.</i>

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.940
Are you really okay with this, Rinne-sama?

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:18.840
You ought to join in on the date, Rinne-sama!

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:22.070
I don't have the money to 
spend on such frivolities.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.580
Sure, I guess, but...

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:30.180
Well, Sakura-sama didn't seem too upset 
with going on the date with that guy.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:36.830
<i>What is this sickening sensation, like I'd 
just stepped on a caterpillar in Hell?</i>

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:38.900
There you are.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.840
Hey, Rokudou-kun.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:46.090
Hey, I heard about the double 
date from Sakura-chan.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.480
Huh? Rokudou-kun.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.110
Miho-chan, Sakura-chan.

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.380
Huh? Why?

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.780
I wanted to come with you guys.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.580
Let's have fun.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.000
I'm so happy.

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.850
You're here, too?

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.080
To protect the spirit.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:24.160
I'll exorcise him the moment 
he does anything suspicious.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:28.110
And don't get between me and Mamiya-san.

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:30.900
Come on, let's go.

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:32.790
I'll pay for you, Mamiya-san.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.420
Huh? But...

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:35.560
Don't worry about it.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.090
Don't worry about your fee.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.110
Huh? But...

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.280
It's a business expense.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.690
Don't worry about it.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:46.750
I invited her. I can't let a girl pay.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:51.620
So the guy's supposed to pay in 
these situations? I never knew.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.820
Four students...

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:08.360
<i>I wonder if Rokudou-kun doesn't mind.</i>

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.380
<i>It looked like he paid for the others, too.</i>

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.260
<i>I'm in the red!</i>

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.760
<i>He's already weeping blood.</i>

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.050
That was fun.

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:21.350
I'm thirsty. Rokudou-kun, buy me juice.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:24.770
<i>Rika-chan's totally going 
to mooch off of him.</i>

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.420
Mamiya-san.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.150
Take whatever you like.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:33.820
There's so much stuff! It's all so tempting!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.200
Yay! Gimme, gimme!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.950
Me, too.

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.500
You look good.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.080
Thanks.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.390
Wait, Jumonji.

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:47.220
What are you here to do?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.930
To keep an eye on the spirit, of course.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.850
But since I'm also getting an opportunity 
to go on a date with Mamiya-san,

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.430
I have to make sure my partner has fun.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.430
Oh, let's ride that one next.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:01.810
Exorcism < Date

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:01.810
<i>This kid...</i>

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.460
date date date date date
date date exorcism exorcism

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:03.880
<i>He must be something like this.</i>

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.250
You're right, Tsubasa-kun.

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.750
We should have fun, now that we're here.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.820
Let's forget about everything.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.060
Yup!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.700
Ding!

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:12.700
date date date date date date date date date

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.590
<i>What the hell's going on?</i>

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.320
Isn't this fun, Mamiya-san?

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.170
Yeah.

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.590
Awesome.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:32.750
Isn't this fun, Mamiya-san?

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.590
I can't get it.

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.380
You suck at this, Rika-chan.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.400
I already wasted 2,000 yen.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.610
<i>This girl's so stingy when 
she's paying offerings.</i>

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.930
All right, another 500 yen.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:52.030
I'll do it.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.610
You're amazing, Rokudou-kun!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:58.850
He really makes his money count.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.040
He's going for the best 
returns on his investments.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.690
Mamiya-san, is there one you want?

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:05.120
That one, then.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:16.850
Almost.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.760
Almost.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.810
Yay!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.490
Thanks, Rokudou-kun.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.020
I didn't pay for it, though.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.020
I'll cherish it.

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:31.020
<i>This is kind of fun.</i>

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:34.500
Rokudou, don't go thinking you've won.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.970
You do, don't you?!

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.660
You think you've won!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.710
I can see it on your face!

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.080
Let's go put this stuff in a locker.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.270
Okay.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.160
I haven't lost!

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.160
Let's go.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:47.700
Hey, Sakura-chan.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.540
Hm?

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.680
Are you going to keep dating Jumonji-kun?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.050
Huh? Well...

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.090
Oh, really?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:57.100
Poor Rokudou-kun.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:59.640
He seems to like you.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.250
No way.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:03.130
I can tell since he's with us.

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:04.970
He steals glances at you.

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.420
Huh?

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.600
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.400
<i>No, he's glaring at his wallet.</i>

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:16.930
Rokudou, you haven't eaten or drank anything.

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.190
Do you not have money?

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:21.530
Sorry, it's because he's 
paying for all of my food.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:22.980
Don't worry about it.

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:24.040
Are you having fun?

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.950
Yeah, I'm having so much fun.

00:18:27.820 --> 00:18:31.580
I'm sickly, and I didn't get 
to hang out with friends.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:37.170
This is my first time coming to 
an amusement park with friends.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.460
I get it.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.440
I moved so much, I could 
never make friends either.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.960
Although I never felt lonely,

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.810
because I had memories of the 
time I spent with Mamiya-san.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.730
That's so nice.

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:58.870
I thought I could never come 
again, since I became poor.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:18:59.850
Rokudou.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:01.900
Have this.

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:03.220
Jumonji.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.650
Don't be modest.

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:06.820
You already drank some of that.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:09.650
That bugs you? But you're poor.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:11.830
Let's take a picture.

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:13.240
Yeah.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.720
Rika-chan, please.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.150
Okay.

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.480
Let's take another one.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:24.910
Rinne-sama.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.140
Here it is.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.550
Thanks, Rokumon.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.470
Here.

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:30.850
The Camera of the Underworld.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:39.240
Camera of the Underworld

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:33.920
<i>Shinigami tool: Camera of the Underworld.</i>

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.990
<i>A photo taken with this camera 
gets developed instantly,</i>

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.240
<i>and can be taken to the next world.</i>

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:42.260
It was surprisingly expensive for a rental.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.490
Rental fee
 1 Camera of the Underworld
 1 Film
 Total: 3,000 yen

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.010
Make sure it's in focus and stuff.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.790
Film isn't free.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.290
I know.

00:19:57.270 --> 00:19:59.090
Whoa, thanks.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.300
This'll be a good memory.

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:02.720
Yeah.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.070
Let's go on the Ferris wheel next.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:07.680
It's four people each, so four and two.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:08.930
Okay.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.150
It's about time.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:12.520
Is he going to pass on?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.400
Hurry.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.170
I have to see him off.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.330
Wait.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:21.070
What are you doing, trying 
to get on with Mamiya-san?

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.030
My work.

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.530
I guess you two are getting on after.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.610
Such a nice view.

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:34.030
Miho-san, thanks for everything today.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.040
I had fun, too.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.670
Let's come again once you're 
out of the hospital.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:38.790
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.050
<i>He's getting faint.</i>

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.050
Pretty.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.020
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:01.590
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.610
<i>This is Rokudou's way of doing things.</i>

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:06.610
Huh?

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:07.570
Hm?

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:12.520
What?

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:13.850
Why? Why?

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:16.560
Don't tell me he was a spirit or something.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:19.280
Gee, I wonder.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:20.820
What are you going to do about this?

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.260
Oh, yeah, that picture I took earlier.

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:25.380
He's a bit faint!

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:28.230
I wonder if he really was a spirit.

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:30.260
He wasn't scary at all.

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:33.090
He must have been a good spirit.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:34.200
Yeah.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:36.640
That settles everything.

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:39.150
Really? That's it?

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:44.950
Rinne-sama, how was the date?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.400
It wasn't a date.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:49.530
It ended up costing a lot, huh?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.080
But hey, it's all right. It was fun.

00:21:57.930 --> 00:21:59.820
<i>Fun, huh?</i>

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.710
<i>I'll cherish it.</i>

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>Mamiya Sakura was kind of cute.</i>

00:22:08.980 --> 00:22:11.330
<i>Rokudou-kun got this for me.</i>

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:14.510
<i>Now that I look at it, it's not that cute.</i>

00:22:14.510 --> 00:22:15.760
<i>Oh, well.</i>

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode
 Hanako-san

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:02.490
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:04.670
Ch-o-co-la-te.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:05.960
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:07.500
Pi-ne-a-pp-le.

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:08.810
I lost again!

00:24:08.810 --> 00:24:10.420
What are you two doing?

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:12.510
I heard the next story's 
a spoken story, so...

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:13.630
So he challenged me for some reason.

00:24:13.630 --> 00:24:15.010
No, that's not it.

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:17.720
It's spooky stories next week.

00:24:18.100 --> 00:24:20.220
Like, school horror story type stuff?

00:24:20.220 --> 00:24:21.240
Yeah.

00:24:21.240 --> 00:24:24.340
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"Hanako-san."

00:24:24.340 --> 00:24:26.820
Next week I'll have victory over Rokudou!
